t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">特斯拉车机语音大模型在沪完成生成式人工智能服务备案</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Z 世代 AI 态度大转弯：警惕感上升，兴奋度骤降</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google 发布 Deep Research 与 Max 智能体，支持 MCP 协议实现深度调研自动化</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">萤石发布首款智能大模型主机EZVIZ AI Core X，内置64Tops端侧算力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2833cee7255815769e1eb17e17594f04.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月22日，萤石正式发布首款智能大模型主机EZVIZ AI Core X，旨在通过本地化算力重塑家庭智能设备协同。该主机内置64Tops端侧算力，配备24GB内存与128GB闪存，支持在本地高效处理复杂AI任务。核心软件方面，该产品搭载萤石蓝海大模型2.0及本地智能体Home Vita，支持自然语言交互与操作记忆功能。在兼容性上，除支持萤石全系设备外，该主机还兼容Matter协议，实现对第三方智能硬件的统一纳管。安全性方面，AI Core X支持家庭数据本地化存储与分区管理，并具备AI语义化处理能力，可将监控告警聚合成事件简报，支持口语化检索录像与图片。目前该产品已正式亮相，具体售价暂未公布，为家庭用户提供了兼顾隐私安全与极致智能体验的本地化底座方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云正式开源 AI Agent 执行环境底座 CubeSandbox</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/89999964d31ec2297991af18239956e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云今日正式开源专为 AI Agent 设计的执行环境底座 CubeSandbox。该项目是业内首个实现硬件级隔离且启动速度达亚百毫秒级的开源沙箱。CubeSandbox 原生支持 E2B 接口标准，开发者可实现现有 Agent 应用的“零成本”迁移。技术上，通过资源池化、快照克隆及底层锁优化，其冷启动时间缩短至 60 毫秒以内，50 并发下平均响应时间仅 67 毫秒。在资源控制方面，利用 Rust 重写、CoW 内存复用及 reflink 磁盘共享技术，将单实例内存开销降至 5MB 以内，单台 96 核服务器可支持超 2000 个沙箱并发运行。该方案已在腾讯“元宝”AI 编程等生产场景中验证，资源核时消耗降低 95.8%。CubeSandbox 具备硬件级隔离与精细化网络权限配置，支持从基础应用到复杂 Ag</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉车机语音大模型在沪完成生成式人工智能服务备案</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/051c994d037fc0f98e702cc138e3f710.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉（上海）有限公司的车机语音大模型服务已于4月20日正式完成生成式人工智能服务备案。此次备案标志着特斯拉智能座舱的本土化进化迈出关键一步，AI技术应用场景从手机App端的xBot客服正式延伸至车辆物理空间的交互核心。通过接入更强大的生成式AI能力，特斯拉车机系统将具备更深度的自然语言理解能力，能够提供更具逻辑性和情感温度的交互反馈。此前，特斯拉的xBot客户服务已于去年11月成为国内首批获批上线的外企大模型产品。此次车机端模型的备案，预示着国内特斯拉车主即将获得更智能、自然的语音操控体验，推动智能座舱交互从指令式向对话式升级，进一步提升车辆的智能化水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Z 世代 AI 态度大转弯：警惕感上升，兴奋度骤降</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5dec9d2fb0b792e31779d83066d81c11.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Z 世代 AI 态度大转弯：警惕感上升，兴奋度骤降AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 22, 20266一项针对 Z 世代的最新民调显示，年轻人对人工智能的态度正变得前所未有的复杂。尽管大多数受访者承认 AI 将在未来的教育和职业中占据核心地位，但他们对这项技术的抵触情绪正在显著增加。数据显示，自2025年以来，Z 世代对 AI 的兴奋度下降了14%。与此同时，对这些工具表示“愤怒”的情绪比例却在攀升，反映出年轻群体对技术失控的深层忧虑。职场与校园双重焦虑，风险感知超过收益 在职场领域，这种不确定感尤为强烈。约有48% 的在职 Z 世代认为，AI 进入职场所带来的风险已经超过了其带来的便利。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google 发布 Deep Research 与 Max 智能体，支持 MCP 协议实现深度调研自动化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/de7d73ac2271f2765eb8ad7aaba701a8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google 正式发布基于 Gemini 3.1 Pro 模型的 Deep Research 和 Deep Research Max 自主调研智能体，现已通过付费版 Gemini API 向开发者开放预览。Deep Research 侧重低延迟响应，Max 版本则通过更长的计算时间进行深度逻辑推理，支持异步处理复杂尽职调查并生成结构化报告。该系统核心亮点在于支持 MCP（模型上下文协议），允许智能体连接企业私有数据库及专业行业数据源，实现从搜索引擎向垂直领域数字员工的跨越。此外，该智能体具备原生图表生成能力，并支持用户在调研前协同制定搜索计划。此次发布标志着 AI 助手从简单问答转向复杂任务执行，通过自动化工作流大幅降低专业调研门槛，提升金融、市场等领域的数据分析效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
